# Shrieker (REL 69) forced arms, Torvus Bog 02_swamp_greatbridge (area 9): the echo visor on a
# faded (buried) Shrieker (Render), ReturnToStart at its start point (CloseToStart arm),
# BuriedRumbling and Retreat bodies (statecall), a dark combo on a buried one (KnockBack hurled
# while buried) and a second hit after death (mDeathKnockBackStarted).
# Run: BUILD=build-port-cov tools/cov/run.sh tools/cov/specs/shrieker.py <out> 3dfd2249,02_swamp_greatbridge \
#        --con tools/drivers/shrieker_forced.con --fast --frames 4000
@f600 god 1
@f700 visor echo
@f900 place e000900c9 player 12
@f1000 obj e000900c9
@f1200 visor combat
@f1300 statecall e00090071 BuriedRumbling 0
@f1310 statecall e00090071 BuriedRumbling 1
@f1320 statecall e00090071 BuriedRumbling 2
@f1330 statecall e00090071 Retreat 1
@f1400 fsm e00090071 ReturnToStart
@f1800 obj e00090071
@f2000 obj e0009007b
@f2100 damage e0009007b 999 0 darkburst
@f2110 damage e0009007b 5
@f2400 place e00090071 player 8
@f2700 damage e00090071 999
@f2710 damage e00090071 5
@f3000 objs shrieker
